        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Net Loss</font><font style="font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Our pro&#160;forma net loss decreased by $0.8&#160;million to a loss of $5.8&#160;million for the three&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2023 compared to a loss of $6.6&#160;million for the corresponding fiscal period in 2022 primarily due to less operating expenses partially offset by lower gross profit. </font>
        </div>
